  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/295",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">두둥~<br>&#160;<br>Gemini Canvas 기능을 이용하고,<br>재과만 운영진 선생님들의 1차 피드백을 받아<br>&#39;중학교 과학 지필고사 문항생성기&#39;를 만들었습니다!<br>&#160;<br>자유롭게 문항 제작에 활용하시고요.<br>&#160;<br>대신~<br>AI가 만들어준 문항 중에서<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">좋은 문항 1개를</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&#39;캡쳐&#39; 하여</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">재과만 문제은행에</span><span style=\"color: #f89009;\"> &#39;꼬옥&#39; </span><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">올려주세요~</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c0b118f7be51e1e884622c79be13be4c06a8fe0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c0b118f7be51e1e884622c79be13be4c06a8fe0\" data-origin-width=\"280\" data-origin-height=\"330\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>그럼~<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&#39;중학교 과학 문항 피드백 &amp; 문항 생성기&#39;</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">2022 개정교육과정을 반영한 맞춤형 평가 도우미<br>(Made by 재미있는 과학수업 만들기) 를&#160;<br>공개합니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d14d0cd1a590256d79880e164a77bb2d5815bcfc\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"590\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d14d0cd1a590256d79880e164a77bb2d5815bcfc\" data-origin-width=\"958\" data-origin-height=\"569\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&lt;사용법 안내&gt;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>1. 구글 크롬 열기 - 구글 로그인 하기<br>&#160;<br>2. 바꾸고 싶은 문항을 &#39;화면 캡쳐&#39;한 후 아래의 생성기에 붙여 넣기<br>&#160;<br>&#160;&#160; 1) 기초문항 생성기 : 문제집에서 볼 수 있는 기본적인 문항 제작용<br><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/2a8a41ad2380\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/2a8a41ad2380</a><br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br>&#160; 2) 심화문항 생성기 : 개념 이해, 융합적 사고, 실생활 응용 문항 제작용<br><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/af00ea18306f\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/af00ea18306f</a><br>&#160;&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>&#160;3. 문항 저장 : 생성해준 문항을 화면 캡쳐해서 저장~<br><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;*캡쳐하지 않으면 문항이 사라져요ㅠ</span><br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>4. 캡쳐/저장한 문항 중에 1~2개를 재과만 문제은행에<span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&#160;&#39;꼬옥&#39;</span>&#160;공유!</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">재과만 문제은행 :</span></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><a href=\"https://padlet.com/yhkim22/padlet-ju801dqs2ji3m8ze\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://padlet.com/yhkim22/padlet-ju801dqs2ji3m8ze</a></b></span><br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><b><span style=\"color: #f89009;\">&#39;재과만 문제은행&#39;은</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #f89009;\">우리가 함께 채우는 뽑기상자입니다!</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>* 문항 생성기를 &#39;전학공 활동&#39; 에도 활용해보세요~</b><br>&#160; 기존 문항 분석&amp;피드백, AI를 활용한 문항제작에 너무 좋네요!<br>&#160; &#160;(문의&amp;제안 : 경기메신저(운암고 김영학) ,&#160; sedu21@hanmail.net&#160; 연락주세요~)&#160;&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"재과만 문제은행\" data-og-description=\"Padlet으로 만듦\" data-og-host=\"padlet.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://padlet.com/yhkim22/padlet-ju801dqs2ji3m8ze\" data-og-url=\"https://padlet.com/yhkim22/padlet-ju801dqs2ji3m8ze\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/0bdkN/dJMb8869caq/TujIn38imMA6sH13zV59O1/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/5w514/dJMb85WTIq0/T3QjDMd23WJdrj7VhDba71/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=675&amp;face=0_0_1200_675\"><a href=\"https://padlet.com/yhkim22/padlet-ju801dqs2ji3m8ze\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://padlet.com/yhkim22/padlet-ju801dqs2ji3m8ze\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/0bdkN/dJMb8869caq/TujIn38imMA6sH13zV59O1/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/5w514/dJMb85WTIq0/T3QjDMd23WJdrj7VhDba71/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=675&amp;face=0_0_1200_675\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">재과만 문제은행</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Padlet으로 만듦</p><p class=\"og-host\">padlet.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
